# OpenCode watcher aliases
# Format: <alias> <tmux-target> <project-path>
# Aliases are canonical. If a pane disappears or tmux restarts,
# the watcher reports the alias as missing — it never remaps an alias
# to an unrelated pane. Update this file only with user approval.
feaon opencode-work:0.0 /home/__USER__/projects/personal/Feaon-ldp-v2
qvak opencode-work:0.1 /home/__USER__/projects/personal/qvak-portfolio